nd cohort identification.
*   The paper establishes workflows with quantum optimization and quan
tum machine learning methods for these subproblems.
*   Quantum differential solvers can enhance understanding of drug mec
hanistic properties and optimize logistical steps for site and cohort 
selection.
*   Quantum generative models are proposed to improve cohort identific
ation.
