AB  - This article describes the steps of the development and the structure 
of a disease-specific clinical trials network for cystic fibrosis in E
urope. Activities such as reviewing study protocols, feasibility asses
sments, training and standardizing of procedures, and outcome measurem
ents help to bring high-quality clinical trials to the patients. Coope
ration with the pharmaceutical industry, other research networks, pati
ent organizations, and regulatory agencies is very important throughou
t all activities.
